<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Baghdad has moved troops into the Kurdish border region, taking over border posts and oil fields to reinforce central authority, while the defense ministry ordered a nationwide deployment and closed oil smuggling routes. Iran-linked militias are involved in negotiations over Jurf al-Nasr, and Iraq has closed a border crossing with Iran in the Kurdistan Region on Baghdad’s orders, prompting protests over the seizure of Kurdish oil. Germany arrested an Iraqi duo suspected of plotting attacks on a synagogue, and an Iraqi court sentenced eight French nationals to life imprisonment for IS group membership. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPT2MxVEJYVHRnSDRQZzRETWUyMnlCYUJDTTVTVzNuenBwRkRKeTgxZnBDR0VUVWt4akRiYzdMSnc5Sk9PWTBUMy00UFNBeUxsU0F1T1dzcFM2QkFuYTJINzZ1WmJzYUxaZnJoM3U1Q1k3N1JjLXZyQ29TS3IwZ1EwQU0yaXVNcnk0Y3ZIWDFuSzlOekJjb0RyMzdBR1N6TXJITGtzM09PQ2s4Ujg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPcFBlZXpjNmxudmFiTnBwb3VTalZDY1JoR3FaYUpabkNycXJfS2x0aDR4Z2NLNEtyRVowTXVIN1BzR1NMZjhBaU9GUzc4RTBUYWZHTFh4NS03dGQxc2lxQnlBQmNkWnVrdFJKU2lwQjc4OUl5VTVYVHlFWGdPT3QtQUN6dFRnZnNXaDRyLTU4ZGt5cUVPeWhISTdUU0ZHTWNzZDktRTZFUFFBckJ2cGIxcWVwRG5mc2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1GX3lDZUMzYWNfV2lGX1ktM0JGUFNKaVEteG16QTBEVmcyUWxvQl9JbFgxU1g5Z3NwS1ppVFRLdTJjcHBKUE9